  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Research Ideas LAND-at-scale - Unpacking tenure security in rural Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This research aims to get better insight in ways in which people in selected areas in Mozambique experience their tenure security, to what extent external factors impact on their tenure security, and how tenure security impacts on lives, livelihoods and resilience of people.</narrative>
